lemma SageX (X:ScreensJ P)(F:ℕ→P.Test)(v:VistaX x X F) : AttainedR x X:=⟨F,fun i σ τ=>by obtain ⟨A,p,q⟩:=v i σ τ; exact ⟨A,p,q.mono fun i u=>⟨i,u⟩⟩⟩
abbrev PoseF_S (x:P.VMark)(F:ℕ→P.Test)(s:ℕ):P.Test:= if h:∃ u:Cover,P.vtile s u=x then P.chartAll h.choose (F s) else 0
lemma VistaV_S (x y:P.VMark)(F:ℕ→P.Test)(A:ScreensJ P)(p:VistaX x A F): VistaX (x+y) (WayMoveR P y A) (PoseF_S y F):=by
 let Z:=WayMoveR P y A; intro i σ τ; obtain ⟨a,h,t⟩:=p i σ τ
 let V:=P.ambientTurn i y; let F':ℕ→P.Slabs i:=V ∘ a
 have ht:Continuous V:=by unfold V ambientTurn; fun_prop
 refine ⟨F',ht.continuousAt.tendsto.comp h,?_⟩; filter_upwards[t,mint_voxel y] with i' d e
 have he:= habit_tokenS i d e.choose; dsimp only at he; rw[e.choose_spec] at he
 unfold PoseF_S; rw[dif_pos e]; change P.HabitLevel _ _ _ (x i + y i-_) (x i+y i+_) _ _; rw[show x i+y i - _ = x i-σ.val +y i from (by abel), show x i+y i + _ = x i+τ.val+y i from (by abel)]; exact he -- tune
lemma SlingV_S (Y:ScreensJ P)(p:VenueY (0:P.VMark) Y):∀ x:P.VMark,∃ F:ℕ→P.Test, VistaX x (WayMoveR P x Y) F:=by
 intro x; obtain ⟨K,t⟩:=p; exact ⟨_,zero_add x ▸ VistaV_S 0 x K Y (VistaS _ _ _ t)⟩
